n-county"],["ARC or PLC in Marion County","/arc-plc/south-carolina/marion-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2026 so far, the middle of the grids had March to April at 23% of normal and February to March at 56%. Grid 16704 had its driest year in 2007 at 63% of normal.</p>"}
